WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.140
After the surgery site has healed, you return for

2
00:00:04.172 --> 00:00:05.740
your first programming visit.

3
00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:10.420
At this visit, a hearing specialist called an audiologist

4
00:00:10.518 --> 00:00:14.020
programs the speech processor you wear outside your ear.

5
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.900
The program is made for your needs.

6
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.620
At later visits, the team checks the implant and equipment

7
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.380
and measures how they are working.

8
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.740
You will keep returning for checks and fine-tuning.
